; The plugin's Rocq-level tests (LogTest.v: Sylvan's proof log, kept and
; checked; CongruenceTest.v: the reorderings found in the rules).
; Built by `dune build` and CI. Not part of the opam package (there is no
; `(package ...)`), so `dune build -p rocq-mebi @install`, which is what
; opam runs, neither builds nor installs them.
;
; They are not in theories/ because dune maps a directory to one logical path,
; so a second theory there would shadow MEBI.
(rocq.theory
 (name MEBITests)
 (synopsis "MEBI plugin tests")
 (plugins rocq-mebi.mebi)
 (stdlib yes)
 (theories Stdlib MEBI))
